  {
    "hotel_id": "93243692",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/trangtrang-central-hotel/hotel/hanoi-vn.html",
    "name": "TrangTrang Central Hotel",
    "detail": "The location is really good. It's located in the old town, so you can walk to Hoan Kiem Lake, and there are many restaurants and cafes around, making it convenient for traveling. The room I stayed in had a window facing the street, so it was a bit noisy at night. Since it's in the center of the Old Quarter, some noise should be expected. However, the front desk provided free earplugs, which I used while sleeping, and it was okay. For those who are sensitive to noise, it might be a good idea to ask if there are any rooms facing inward when checking in. The room was clean, and the staff were really friendly. They helped me immediately whenever I needed something and always greeted me with a smile, which made my stay pleasant. I would recommend it more for those who want to conveniently explore Hanoi's old town in a good location rather than for those who want a completely quiet hotel. I would be willing to stay here again when I come to Hanoi next time :)",
