  {
    "hotel_id": "85405330",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hanoi-re-hostel-2/hotel/hanoi-vn.html",
    "name": "2Re Hidden Hostel - Old Quarter Hanoi - Free Breakfast",
    "detail": "It is located about a 5-minute walk from the old town and within a 10-minute walk from the arrival and departure point of bus number 86 from the airport, so the location was very good. However, you have to go down a very narrow road from the main street, and when I went there, they were doing wiring work on that road, which made it a little difficult to find. The room was clean, with lights, space to place items, and personal lockers, making it comfortable. The toilet was rather narrow, and the toilet paper was placed behind, which made it somewhat inconvenient to use. The shower rooms are separated by gender on the second floor, with three each, and hairdryers were provided there. The shower rooms had no partitions, so you had to come up with a way to change without getting your towel wet. Additionally, there was no hot water. The staff were kind. Towels were exchanged daily. Breakfast included bread, coffee, milk, and water. The card key had a mysterious system that required charging, and I couldn't get into my room several times, so I had to go to the front desk to have it charged. They were very accommodating. Considering this location and this pricing, I think it's a complaint-free hostel.",
